<section xml:id="app-symbolization">
<title>Symbolization</title>
<tabular><col halign="right"/><col halign="left"/>
<row><cell colspan="2" halign="left"><em>Sentential Connectives</em> (chapter <xref ref="ch-SL" text="global"/>)</cell></row>
<row><cell/></row>
<row><cell>It is not the case that <m>P</m>.</cell><cell><m>\enot P</m></cell></row>
<row><cell>Either <m>P</m>, or <m>Q</m>.</cell><cell><m>(P \eor Q)</m></cell></row>
<row><cell>Neither <m>P</m>, nor <m>Q</m>.</cell><cell><m>\enot(P \eor Q)</m> or  <m>(\enot P \eand \enot Q)</m></cell></row>
<row><cell>Both <m>P</m>, and <m>Q</m>.</cell><cell><m>(P \eand Q)</m></cell></row>
<row><cell>If <m>P</m>, then <m>Q</m>.</cell><cell><m>(P \eif Q)</m></cell></row>
<row><cell><m>P</m> only if <m>Q</m>.</cell><cell><m>(P \eif Q)</m></cell></row>
<row><cell><m>P</m> if and only if <m>Q</m>.</cell><cell><m>(P \eiff Q)</m></cell></row>
<row><cell>Unless <m>P</m>, <m>Q</m>. <m>P</m> unless <m>Q</m>.</cell><cell><m>(P \eor Q)</m></cell></row>
<row><cell colspan="2" halign="left"><em>Predicates</em> (chapter <xref ref="ch-QL" text="global"/>)</cell></row>
<row><cell/></row>
<row><cell>All <m>F</m>s are <m>G</m>s.</cell><cell><m>\forall x(Fx \eif Gx)</m></cell></row>
<row><cell>Some <m>F</m>s are <m>G</m>s.</cell><cell><m>\exists x(Fx \eand Gx)</m></cell></row>
<row><cell>Not all <m>F</m>s are <m>G</m>s.</cell><cell><m>\enot\forall x(Fx \eif Gx)</m> or <m>\exists x(Fx \eand \enot Gx)</m></cell></row>
<row><cell>No <m>F</m>s are <m>G</m>s.</cell><cell><m>\forall x(Fx \eif\enot Gx)</m> or <m>\enot\exists x(Fx \eand Gx)</m></cell></row>
<row><cell colspan="2" halign="left"><em>Identity</em> (chapter <xref ref="ch-identity" text="global"/>)</cell></row>
<row><cell/></row>
<row><cell>Only <m>j</m> is <m>G</m>.</cell><cell><m>\forall x(Gx \eiff x{=}j)</m></cell></row>
<row><cell>Everything besides <m>j</m> is <m>G</m>.</cell><cell><m>\forall x(x {\neq} j \eif Gx)</m></cell></row>
<row><cell>The <m>F</m> is <m>G</m>.</cell><cell><m>\exists x(Fx \eand \forall y(Fy \eif x{=}y) \eand Gx)</m></cell></row>
<row><cell>The <m>F</m> is not <m>G</m>.</cell><cell><m>\exists x(Fx \eand \forall y(Fy \eif x{=}y) \eand \enot Gx)</m></cell></row></tabular>
</section>
